Would you mind flirting when you get
home from this official business?

1538
00:03:40,290 --> 00:03:42,540
There's the Ice Demonâ€¦

1539
00:03:44,570 --> 00:03:50,820
<i>Although Your Highness' destination of the Miseral Dukedom
is an ally of the Sauslind Kingdomâ€¦</i>

1540
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:52,210
<i>if anything should happen along the wayâ€¦</i>

1541
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,390
Eliâ€¦

1542
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:57,500
Your Highnessâ€¦

1543
00:03:58,220 --> 00:04:05,220
Which would be more effective: a doll with human hair,
or letters written in blood with a quill pen?

1544
00:04:06,630 --> 00:04:07,560
Excuse me?

1545
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:11,940
It's something to protect Your Highness on the journey.

1546
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:13,160
Protect meâ€¦

1547
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:18,440
Yes. For the doll I'd need a bit of Your Highness' hair.

1548
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:24,290
The other will require that I write your name repeatedly
with my own blood as ink

1549
00:04:25,430 --> 00:04:29,750
If I take good care of the doll
then Your Highness will be protected, and if I use the quill,

1550
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:33,710
