1551
00:04:34,380 --> 00:04:39,630
In my opinion, the quill appears
to be the more practical of the two, butâ€¦

1552
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:42,010
That's basically a curse, isn't it?

1553
00:04:42,010 --> 00:04:42,470
Huh?!

1554
00:04:46,230 --> 00:04:52,400
Well, just the fact that Lady Elianna
has just started showing interest in that field is a plus.

1555
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:54,230
At least His Highness is the only "victim."

1556
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:56,150
Oh?

1557
00:04:56,470 --> 00:04:59,780
Er, I mean! It's about time we departâ€¦

1558
00:05:03,550 --> 00:05:07,700
Eli, were you worried about me?

1559
00:05:12,330 --> 00:05:16,050
I'm praying for your safety along the journey there.

1560
00:05:16,250 --> 00:05:17,180
Right.

1561
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,680
Well, I kind of suspected that would be your answer.

1562
00:05:20,930 --> 00:05:23,140
U-Umâ€¦

1563
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:26,930
<i>There should be something else I want to tell him, butâ€¦</i>

1564
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:31,940
I will serve your name well in the Eidel Domain.

1565
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,520
<i>I can't get the words right...</i>

1566
00:05:35,110 --> 00:05:38,650
I won't do anything
that will sully the name of Your Highness.

1567
00:05:38,650 --> 00:05:40,900
<i>How do I tell His Highnessâ€¦</i>

1568
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:46,280
Okay. But make sure you don't push yourself too hard,
and if anything happens consult my uncle.

1569
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:49,990
No, consult whoever you are with.

1570
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:49,990
Hmm?

1571
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:57,300
While I am gone make certain no harm come
 to any inch of your bodyâ€”not even to a single strand of your hair.

1572
00:05:58,460 --> 00:06:01,340
