1573
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:02,050
Pardon?

1574
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:06,990
Now, let's head out.

1575
00:06:11,620 --> 00:06:14,940
<i>Your Highnessâ€¦ I'm lonely.</i>

1576
00:06:15,820 --> 00:06:19,190
<i>I'm so lonely!</i>

1577
00:06:20,390 --> 00:06:21,510
Your Highness!

1578
00:06:24,810 --> 00:06:27,070
U-Umâ€¦

1579
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:28,570
Wellâ€¦

1580
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:34,830
H-How could I do such a thing in publicâ€¦

1581
00:06:35,890 --> 00:06:38,590
Eliâ€¦ Have you come to give me a good luck charm?

1582
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:49,470
What you were wearing will keep me safe on my journey.

1583
00:06:49,990 --> 00:06:57,030
I'll be waiting for your return.
Please come back safeâ€¦ Your Highness.

1584
