1607
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:23,320
The women who don't have a fiancÃ©e
all have the jitters.

1608
00:08:23,690 --> 00:08:29,140
By the way, where's Lord Alfred?
Lord Alexei isn't here either, thoughâ€¦

1609
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:31,570
