1610
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:35,330
What?! Then who is protecting you, Eli?!

1611
00:08:35,330 --> 00:08:39,710
"P-Protecting"? That's a bit muchâ€¦

1612
00:08:39,710 --> 00:08:41,080
Goodness, Eliâ€¦

