1628
00:09:47,610 --> 00:09:52,990
It's fine to be a little more demanding, you know?
Gentlemen enjoy entertaining a ladyâ€™s personal requests.

1629
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:54,830
Y-Yes.

1630
00:09:54,830 --> 00:10:01,120
Speaking of, Lady Kreis, there was a gentleman
I hadn't seen before amongst the men.

1631
00:10:01,460 --> 00:10:05,850
Yes, he is the son of a dear old friend
who married in a foreign country.

1632
00:10:05,850 --> 00:10:09,760
